  "description": "Find the start and end indices of all groups of 3 or more identical consecutive characters.",
  "pseudocode": "1: let res = [], n = s.length\n2: for (let i = 0, j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n3:   if (j === n - 1 || s[j] !== s[j + 1]) {\n4:     if (j - i + 1 >= 3) res.push([i, j])\n5:     i = j + 1\n6:   }\n7: }",
